nidan sobre los tejados de Altreu?","options":["Garzas reales","Cisnes","Grullas","Cigüeñas blancas"],"explanation":"Altreu está ligado a la recuperación de la cigüeña blanca en Suiza; hoy las aves asentadas buscan su alimento.","sources":[{"id":"so-storks-17","url":"https://www.selzach.ch/tourismus/storchensiedlung-altreu/storchensiedlung-altreu.html/144","title":"Solothurn · Cigüeñas de Altreu","authority":"Gemeinde Selzach","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Infozentrum Witi Altreu, texto principal"}],"source_url":"https://www.selzach.ch/tourismus/storchensiedlung-altreu/storchensiedlung-altreu.html/144","source_title":"Solothurn · Cigüeñas de Altreu","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SO:altreu-observar","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":3,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["46a2ce2120941d3dcf19f66692885c49"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-curso-alfabetizacion","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"idioma","category":"idioma","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres aprender alemán en Solothurn y necesitas empezar por la lectura y escritura básicas. ¿Qué oferta conviene consultar?","options":["Alphabetisierungskurs","Konversationskurs avanzado","Prüfungsvorbereitung C2","Führerscheinprüfung"],"explanation":"Es un curso de alfabetización. La entidad organiza la orientación al nivel adecuado.","sources":[{"id":"so-courses-17","url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","authority":"Amt für Gesellschaft und Soziales Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Deutsch-Integrationskurse: ofertas, costes y Betreuung"}],"source_url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","source_title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SO:curso-alfabetizacion","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["7fd98b608a7f4364eb6aaa87040e393f"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-curso-antes-pago","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Recibes asistencia social en Solothurn y quieres que se cubra un curso subvencionado. ¿Qué indica el cantón antes de apuntarte?","options":["Pagar con la tarjeta de otra persona","Obtener la Kostengutsprache del servicio social","Suponer que todos los cursos son gratuitos","Esperar a terminar para preguntar"],"explanation":"Es un compromiso previo de cobertura del coste. No equivale a una aprobación automática para cualquier curso.","sources":[{"id":"so-courses-17","url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","authority":"Amt für Gesellschaft und Soziales Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Deutsch-Integrationskurse: ofertas, costes y Betreuung"}],"source_url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","source_title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:curso-antes-pago","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1},"known":["b18323f62ee0d5f077526c643fcef1cb"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-perro-junio-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Es junio y entras con tu perro de compañía en un bosque de Solothurn. ¿Qué debes hacer según la regla estacional?","options":["Soltarlo aunque persiga animales","Atarlo solo si llueve","Llevarlo con correa","Seguir las fechas de cualquier otro cantón"],"explanation":"La regla general del bosque va del 1 de abril al 31 de julio. La pregunta no trata de perros con una excepción oficial por funciones específicas.","sources":[{"id":"so-dog-law-17","url":"https://bgs.so.ch/api/de/versions/5647/pdf_file","title":"Solothurn · Normativa de perros vigente","authority":"Kanton Solothurn, BGS 614.72","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Versión 1 junio 2026, §§ 1, 3 y 4"},{"id":"so-wildlife-17","url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-wald-jagd-und-fischerei/wildtiere/mit-hund-im-wald-leinenpflicht/","title":"Solothurn · Perros y fauna del bosque","authority":"Amt für Wald, Jagd und Fischerei Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Leinenpflicht y Jungtiere"}],"source_url":"https://bgs.so.ch/api/de/versions/5647/pdf_file","source_title":"Solothurn · Normativa de perros vigente","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:perro-junio-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2},"known":["df0b6fd5bd4887e26487038b79fa2409"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-american-bully-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres tener un American Bully en Solothurn. En la normativa vigente desde junio de 2026, ¿qué situación corresponde a esa raza?","options":["Prohibida sin posibilidad de autorización","No existe ninguna regla específica","Se permite con una simple opinión del vendedor","Está sujeta a autorización y requisitos"],"explanation":"La ordenanza incluye American Bully y sus cruces en la lista de autorización. Consulta al Veterinärdienst antes de adquirirlo: no se concede automáticamente.","sources":[{"id":"so-dog-law-17","url":"https://bgs.so.ch/api/de/versions/5647/pdf_file","title":"Solothurn · Normativa de perros vigente","authority":"Kanton Solothurn, BGS 614.72","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Versión 1 junio 2026, §§ 1, 3 y 4"}],"source_url":"https://bgs.so.ch/api/de/versions/5647/pdf_file","source_title":"Solothurn · Normativa de perros vigente","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:american-bully-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":3},"known":["90380b6539410910a20febbdd0406aa7"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-corzo-cria-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Ves una cría de corzo tumbada sola en un bosque de Solothurn, sin señales claras de lesión. ¿Qué recomienda el cantón?","options":["No tocarla ni llevártela; su madre puede estar cerca","Darle leche inmediatamente","Subirla al coche para adoptarla","Moverla para hacer una foto"],"explanation":"Las crías pueden esperar solas mientras sus madres buscan alimento. Ante dudas, contacta con la policía para ayuda especializada.","sources":[{"id":"so-wildlife-17","url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-wald-jagd-und-fischerei/wildtiere/mit-hund-im-wald-leinenpflicht/","title":"Solothurn · Perros y fauna del bosque","authority":"Amt für Wald, Jagd und Fischerei Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Leinenpflicht y Jungtiere"}],"source_url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/volkswirtschaftsdepartement/amt-fuer-wald-jagd-und-fischerei/wildtiere/mit-hund-im-wald-leinenpflicht/","source_title":"Solothurn · Perros y fauna del bosque","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SO:corzo-cria-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0},"known":["28c85b736fb29a86f4f536f3d0a627b3"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-residuos-casco-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En el casco antiguo de la ciudad de Solothurn utilizas un contenedor soterrado destinado a basura doméstica. ¿Qué exige el municipio para los residuos?","options":["Una bolsa cualquiera sin tasa","Bolsas oficiales sujetas a tasa","Un saco de otro país sin marcar","Dejarlos al lado para evitar la tasa"],"explanation":"Se refiere a esos contenedores concretos de la ciudad. No autoriza usar cualquier depósito con cualquier bolsa.","sources":[{"id":"so-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt-solothurn.ch/abfalldaten?_display-mode=normal","title":"Solothurn ciudad · Residuos","authority":"Stadt Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Entsorgungsblatt y Unterflurcontainer Altstadt"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt-solothurn.ch/abfalldaten?_display-mode=normal","source_title":"Solothurn ciudad · Residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:residuos-casco-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1},"known":["ecfa4a0817c7447f1ef79c228b247462"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-calendario-residuos-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Te mudas a la ciudad de Solothurn y no sabes qué día se recoge el cartón. ¿Qué herramienta debes consultar?","options":["La fecha de tu cumpleaños","El pronóstico de nieve","El calendario municipal de residuos","El horario de la catedral"],"explanation":"El calendario concreta recogidas y puntos de entrega; no hay un día inventado válido para todo el cantón.","sources":[{"id":"so-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt-solothurn.ch/abfalldaten?_display-mode=normal","title":"Solothurn ciudad · Residuos","authority":"Stadt Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Entsorgungsblatt y Unterflurcontainer Altstadt"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt-solothurn.ch/abfalldaten?_display-mode=normal","source_title":"Solothurn ciudad · Residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:calendario-residuos-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2},"known":["43c9bad38d29dc4858a821cf6f30fac5"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-ipv-treinta-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"AKSO te envía el formulario ordinario de reducción de primas. ¿Dentro de cuánto tiempo indica que debes devolverlo?","options":["Noventa días","Doce meses","Hasta el siguiente año fiscal","Treinta días desde su recepción"],"explanation":"La web indica treinta días. Si tienes dudas sobre tu campaña o caso especial, consulta AKSO sin esperar a otro plazo cantonal.","sources":[{"id":"so-ipv-17","url":"https://www.akso.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung-ipv","title":"Solothurn · Reducción de primas","authority":"Ausgleichskasse des Kantons Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antrag IPV, Quellensteuer 2026"}],"source_url":"https://www.akso.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung-ipv","source_title":"Solothurn · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2026-12-31","concept_id":"SO:ipv-treinta-so","status":"published","validity_year":2026,"editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":3,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["2e660fffc4e9e5d318bedb02a7769925"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-ipv-copias-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Preparas la documentación para IPV 2026 con retención en origen en Solothurn. ¿Cómo pide AKSO los justificantes?","options":["En copias; no enviar los originales","Solo en fotografías sin formulario","Siempre documentos originales que no necesitas conservar","Sin ningún justificante aunque se solicite"],"explanation":"El folleto advierte que los originales enviados no se devuelven. Sigue la lista aplicable a tu solicitud.","sources":[{"id":"so-ipv-qs-17","url":"https://www.akso.ch/uploads/PDF-Formulare-AKSO/IPV/2026_QS-Merkblatt.pdf","title":"Solothurn · IPV 2026 con retención en origen","authority":"Ausgleichskasse des Kantons Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Páginas 1–2, Unterlagen y Fristen"}],"source_url":"https://www.akso.ch/uploads/PDF-Formulare-AKSO/IPV/2026_QS-Merkblatt.pdf","source_title":"Solothurn · IPV 2026 con rete