ias-trabajo-aviso-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["df4c9eec763b6a2047c9edd91577d860"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-curso-hijos-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Necesitas cuidado infantil para poder asistir a alemán en Solothurn. ¿Qué opción realista ofrece la información cantonal?","options":["Dejar al menor en cualquier oficina","Suponer que toda academia lo incluye gratis","Descartar todos los cursos sin preguntar","Consultar las ofertas que incluyen Kinderbetreuung y sus condiciones"],"explanation":"Existen determinadas ofertas con cuidado infantil. Hay que aclarar disponibilidad, condiciones y costes.","sources":[{"id":"so-courses-17","url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","authority":"Amt für Gesellschaft und Soziales Solothurn","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Deutsch-Integrationskurse: ofertas, costes y Betreuung"}],"source_url":"https://so.ch/verwaltung/departement-des-innern/amt-fuer-gesellschaft-und-soziales/integration-und-gleichstellung/integrationsfoerderung/deutsch-integrationskurse/","source_title":"Solothurn · Alemán e integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SO:curso-hijos-so","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":3},"known":["78a8a7a0512b905d4252942aa9a4363c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-reloj-once-so","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","