icada es Romanshorn–Friedrichshafen. Revisa el servicio actual antes de salir.","sources":[{"id":"tg-ferry-17","url":"https://www.bodensee-schiffe.ch/faehre/fahrplan/","title":"Thurgau · Ferry de Romanshorn","authority":"Schweizerische Bodensee-Schifffahrt AG","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Fährverkehr, Winterbetrieb y enlaces de trayecto"}],"source_url":"https://www.bodensee-schiffe.ch/faehre/fahrplan/","source_title":"Thurgau · Ferry de Romanshorn","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TG:ferry-destino","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":1},"known":["b2c38dd0534dbfcbd09133c7cc6882bf"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-tg-integracion-regional","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TG","scope":"canton","canton":"TG","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Acabas de llegar a Thurgau y quieres orientación sobre ofertas de integración de tu zona. ¿Qué recurso ofrece el cantón?","options":["La taquilla de un museo","El servicio de reparaciones del ferry","Los centros regionales de integración","El archivo de camiones históricos"],"explanation":"Los centros informan y orientan sobre recursos regionales; no sustituyen las decisiones de las autoridades.","sources":[{"id":"tg-integration-17","url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/regionale-integrationsbeauftragte.html/9986","title":"Thurgau · Centros regionales de integración","authority":"Migrationsamt Thurgau, Fachstelle Integration","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Regionale Kompetenzzentren, introducción"}],"source_url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/regionale-integrationsbeauftragte.html/9986","source_title":"Thurgau · Centros regionales de integración","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TG:integracion-regional","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2},"known":["8515e47997e055ff76e7aab93f8bf8d3"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-tg-cursos-financiacion","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TG","scope":"canton","canton":"TG","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Cómo describe Thurgau el apoyo cantonal ordinario a determinados cursos de alemán del KIP?","options":["Como pago individual automático a cada residente","Como gratuidad de cualquier academia","Como reembolso sin comprobar el proveedor","Como subvención a determinados proveedores de cursos"],"explanation":"La página distingue el apoyo a proveedores de los posibles apoyos adicionales de algunos municipios.","sources":[{"id":"tg-courses-17","url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/deutschkurse.html/11092","title":"Thurgau · Ofertas de alemán","authority":"Migrationsamt Thurgau, Fachstelle Integration","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Deutschkursliste y financiación"}],"source_url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/deutschkurse.html/11092","source_title":"Thurgau · Ofertas de alemán","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TG:cursos-financiacion","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":3,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["eb097dcd1805fefb97987882ddd507ac"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-tg-curso-ayuda-local","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TG","scope":"canton","canton":"TG","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres saber si puedes recibir ayuda municipal para un curso de alemán en Thurgau. ¿Dónde aconseja preguntar el cantón?","options":["En tu municipio de residencia","Únicamente en una oficina francesa","En cualquier hotel del lago","En el museo industrial"],"explanation":"No todos los municipios ofrecen necesariamente el mismo apoyo. Consulta las condiciones concretas.","sources":[{"id":"tg-courses-17","url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/deutschkurse.html/11092","title":"Thurgau · Ofertas de alemán","authority":"Migrationsamt Thurgau, Fachstelle Integration","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Deutschkursliste y financiación"}],"source_url":"https://migrationsamt.tg.ch/integration/deutschkurse.html/11092","source_title":"Thurgau · Ofertas de alemán","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TG:curso-ayuda-local","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0},"known":["8f686bcb0ca7f2df74d867b2e7573441"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-tg-ipv-2026-fecha","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TG","scope":"canton","canton":"TG","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Para la solicitud ordinaria IPV de Thurgau de 2026, ¿qué fecha límite anunció el cantón?","options":["30 de abril de 2026","31 de diciembre de 2026","31 de marzo de 2028","31 de diciembre de 2025"],"explanation":"Se refiere a la ayuda de 2026 y a ese procedimiento. No se reutiliza como fecha de 2027 sin un nuevo contraste.","sources":[{"id":"tg-ipv-26-17","url":"https://www.tg.ch/news.html/485/news/78692","title":"Thurgau · Reducción de primas 2026","authority":"Kanton Thurgau","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Comunicado 15 mayo 2026, solicitud, pago y casos especiales"}],"source_url":"https://www.tg.ch/news.html/485/news/78692","source_title":"Thurgau · Reducción de primas 2026","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_revi