 paisaje caracteriza al Creux du Van?","options":["Una gran morrena glaciar","Un valle de dunas","Un gran circo rocoso","Una llanura aluvial"],"explanation":"Es una gran pared curva de roca en un entorno natural protegido.","sources":[{"id":"ne-val-travers-17","url":"https://www.j3l.ch/fr/Z12123/lieux/sites-naturels/val-de-travers","title":"Neuchâtel · Val-de-Travers","authority":"Neuchâtel Tourisme, Jura & Trois-Lacs","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Gorges de l’Areuse, Creux du Van y subsuelo"}],"source_url":"https://www.j3l.ch/fr/Z12123/lieux/sites-naturels/val-de-travers","source_title":"Neuchâtel · Val-de-Travers","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"NE:creux-forma","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["5762bfb39dff80e5fcf83d43c89cb244"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ne-areuse-garganta","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"NE","scope":"canton","canton":"NE","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué río da nombre a unas conocidas gargantas del Val-de-Travers?","options":["El Ticino","El Ródano","La Limmat","El Areuse"],"explanation":"La corriente discurre encajada entre paredes de roca en parte de su recorrido.","sources":[{"id":"ne-val-travers-17","url":"https://www.j3l.ch/fr/Z12123/lieux/sites-naturels/val-de-travers","title":"Neuchâtel · Val-de-Travers","authority":"Neuchâtel Tourisme, Jura & Trois-Lacs","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Gorges de l’Areuse, Creux du Van y subsuelo"}],"source_url":"https://www.j3l.ch/fr/Z12123/lieux/sites-naturels/val-de-travers","source_title":"Neuchâtel · Val-de-Travers","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review